            "description_html": "<b>Solid Cast Brass Accents Door Pull Plates</b>\r\n\r\n<p\r\n>Pull plates are 16 ga. (.050) wrought and standard in all metals and finishes. Plates come packed with stainless steel sheet metal screws, plated to match the piece's finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. Their products are hand finished in the USA. They are one of the worlds leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>There are 3 available Plate Sizes.</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A07-P6321: 3\" Wide, 12\" High</li>\r\n<li>A07-P6341: 3-1/2\" Wide, 15\" High</li>\r\n<li>A07-P6351: 4\" Wide, 16\" High</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <b><a href=\"/products/brass-accents-push-plate\">Brass Door Push Plate</a></b>\r\n</p>",
